## Phase 2
<!-- ID: phase_2 -->
- [x] <!-- id: p2-hook-timing --> P4 records hook-only timing, avoids fake `duration_ms=0.0`, and preserves fail-open behavior on daemon/auth/http failures. Proof: hook tests and readback from a `set_project` hook run. | proof=P4 package-specific Crucible PASS 95/100 in REVIEW_P4_CRUCIBLE_20260616; hook-only timing labels and phase buckets verified, fake duration_ms=0.0 removed, fail-open behavior preserved, bounded 1.5s hook lane timeout validated; UV_NO_SYNC=1 hook suites passed 91/91 and endpoint/auth suites passed 51/51. Report quality_check passed with zero warnings. Generated hook propagation/readback remains a rollout caveat, not a P4 source-behavior blocker.
- [x] <!-- id: p2-root-comparison --> P5 reports same-server `scribe_mcp` versus `council_mcp` root timings with explicit hook inclusion labels and Scribe-phase evidence. Proof: structured comparison report. | proof=REVIEW_P5_CRUCIBLE_REVALIDATION_POST_IDENTITY_FIX_20260616 PASS 100/100; same-server probe hook_excluded returned scribe root 428.524/427.864 ms, council root 248.895/248.318 ms, config_mutation=false, classification=inside_scribe_phases; live Postgres preserves separate repo-scoped project rows.
- [x] <!-- id: p2-db-reconciliation --> P6 emits a read-only physical-versus-logical reconciliation report for projects, docs, entries, and tool calls. Proof: diagnostic output and repeat-run no-side-effect evidence. | proof=P6 revalidation PASS 96/100 in REVIEW_P6_CRUCIBLE_REVALIDATION_20260616; non-zero count drift now classifies honestly (2/1 and 5/3 -> missing_logical_rows; 1/2 -> logical_only), read-only/repeat-run behavior remains covered, required tests passed 6/6 and py_compile passed; report quality_check passed with zero warnings.
- [ ] <!-- id: p2-set-project-optimization --> P7 adds a same-session/same-project/same-root `set_project` reuse path that skips duplicate persistent writes, avoids agent-project version bumps, and exposes explicit reuse metadata for downstream hooks. Proof: targeted `tests/test_set_project.py`, before/after structured probe evidence, and Council source-authority uplift/readback for bind-once guidance/hook handling.

